/-!
The table of `Rule30GateObserver`: sets of times on spatial prefixes, on eleven lines of time (the nine words of `factors`,
for rows outside the gate trap; `1001001` six samples after a row in it; `00000`), and the finite checks on it. The tree and
its walk are those of `Rule30TrappedRunMasks`.
-/

@[expose] public section

set_option maxRecDepth 100000
set_option maxHeartbeats 0
set_option Elab.async false
namespace Ruliology.CellularAutomata.Rule30GateObserverTree
open Rule30TrappedRunMasks (Tree checkAt step_all)
open Rule30GateTrap Rule30DrivenPrefix

